        <h2>Documents Needed for Each Family Member</h2>
        <p>Bringing family on a student visa significantly increases the paperwork. Each dependant needs their own complete document package, and all documents require apostille and sworn translation.</p>
      </div>

      <p><strong>Documents for each dependant (spouse, partner, or child):</strong></p>

      <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.3rem; margin-bottom: 2.5rem;">
        <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--red); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Passport</h3>
          <p>Valid for the full duration of the visa period. Include a photocopy alongside the original.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--red); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Proof of relationship</h3>
          <p>For spouse: marriage certificate. For registered partner: pareja de hecho certificate or equivalent registration document. For children: birth certificate showing your name as parent. All require apostille and sworn Spanish translation.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--red); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Criminal record certificate</h3>
          <p>Typically required for adult dependants (spouse, partners, adult children). Must be apostilled and sworn translated. Requirements vary by consulate — check with yours.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--red); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Health insurance certificate</h3>
          <p>Individual policy for each family member meeting visa requirements. Consulate will need the full policy documentation or at minimum an official certificate confirming the coverage meets requirements.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--red); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Proof of financial dependence</h3>
          <p>For children: documentation showing they are dependent on you (e.g., no independent income). For adult children or other adult dependants: proof that they rely financially on you for support.</p>
        </div>

        <div style="border-left: 3px solid var(--red); padding-left: 1.5rem;">
          <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">Shared household documentation</h3>
